Dockerfile
node_modules/
.env
.git
.gitignore

#	`*.md` only matches the root, so prisma/seed-assets/README.md was shipping
#	with the image. Docker patterns are not recursive unless you say so.
**/*.md

#	The seed *fixtures* must ship — the demo has to work offline from a bare
#	clone — but the script that made them must not. It is a developer tool that
#	needs Pillow and ffmpeg, neither of which is in this image, and it writes
#	into a directory the container has no reason to write to.
prisma/seed-assets/generate.py
